<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Token Broker – Guides</title><link>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/pr-preview/pr-18/docs/guides/</link><description>Recent content in Guides on Token Broker</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-US</language><atom:link href="https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/pr-preview/pr-18/docs/guides/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Set up the GitHub Apps</title><link>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/pr-preview/pr-18/docs/guides/github-apps/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/pr-preview/pr-18/docs/guides/github-apps/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;The broker needs two organization-owned GitHub Apps. Settings live under &lt;strong&gt;Organization settings →
Developer settings → GitHub Apps&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Agent app&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Login app&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Purpose&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Identity agents commit, push and open pull requests as&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Proves who a developer is (device flow)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Repository permissions&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Contents RW, Pull requests RW, Issues RW, Metadata R&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;none&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Organization / account permissions&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;none&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;none&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Device flow&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;off&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;on&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Installed&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;on selected repositories&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;not needed&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Broker config&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;GITHUB_APP_ID&lt;/code&gt;, private key&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;LOGIN_APP_CLIENT_ID&lt;/code&gt;, client secret&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="agent-app"&gt;Agent app&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="agent-app"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#agent-app" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The owner is the organization, not a personal account. &lt;strong&gt;Where can this app be installed:&lt;/strong&gt;
only on this account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Webhook:&lt;/strong&gt; active unchecked. The broker receives no events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identifying and authorizing users:&lt;/strong&gt; no callback URL, &lt;strong&gt;Request user authorization (OAuth)
during installation&lt;/strong&gt; off, &lt;strong&gt;Enable Device Flow&lt;/strong&gt; off. User tokens of this app would act as the
developer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Repository permissions:&lt;/strong&gt; Contents, Pull requests and Issues &lt;strong&gt;Read and write&lt;/strong&gt;, Metadata
&lt;strong&gt;Read-only&lt;/strong&gt;. Everything else &lt;strong&gt;No access&lt;/strong&gt;, in particular:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workflows, so an agent cannot edit CI to escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administration, Secrets, Environments and Actions, so it cannot manage repositories or
secrets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Checks and Statuses, so it cannot report a required check as green.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organization&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Account permissions:&lt;/strong&gt; all &lt;strong&gt;No access&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;strong&gt;Subscribe to events:&lt;/strong&gt; none.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private keys:&lt;/strong&gt; generate one key. It goes only into the broker Secret as &lt;code&gt;private-key.pem&lt;/code&gt;,
never into a repository secret or onto a laptop. Delete the downloaded file afterwards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Install App&lt;/strong&gt; on &lt;strong&gt;Only select repositories&lt;/strong&gt;: the repositories agents may work on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The app is &lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; a bypass actor in any ruleset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Note the &lt;strong&gt;App ID&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;config.appId&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every repository the app is installed on must also set &lt;a href="../review-rules/"&gt;review rules&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The broker requests only the four permissions per token, so granting more to the app widens
nothing for agents. &lt;code&gt;AGENT_PERMISSIONS&lt;/code&gt; (chart: &lt;code&gt;config.agentPermissions&lt;/code&gt;) changes that set; every
installation must have accepted each permission in it, or GitHub refuses the token. Keep the app
minimal: the private key alone can mint tokens with everything the app has.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="login-app"&gt;Login app&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="login-app"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#login-app" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The owner is the organization; install only on this account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Webhook:&lt;/strong&gt; active unchecked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Repository&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Organization&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Account permissions:&lt;/strong&gt; all &lt;strong&gt;No access&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable Device Flow&lt;/strong&gt; on. &lt;strong&gt;Expire user authorization tokens&lt;/strong&gt; on: login tokens live 8 hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Callback URL: none needed for device flow. If the form insists, use the broker URL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Request user authorization (OAuth) during installation&lt;/strong&gt; off; the app need not be installed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Note the &lt;strong&gt;Client ID&lt;/strong&gt; (&lt;code&gt;config.loginClientId&lt;/code&gt;). The broker serves it to clients at
&lt;code&gt;/login-app&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate one client secret. It goes only into the broker Secret as &lt;code&gt;login-client-secret&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="broker-secret-and-values"&gt;Broker Secret and values&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="broker-secret-and-values"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#broker-secret-and-values" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;kubectl create secret generic token-broker-credentials &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; --from-file&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;private-key.pem&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&amp;lt;agent-app&amp;gt;.private-key.pem &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; --from-literal&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;login-client-secret&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;$LOGIN_CLIENT_SECRET&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;existingSecret&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;token-broker-credentials&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;config&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;appId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;lt;agent app ID&amp;gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;org&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;my-org&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;loginClientId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;lt;login app client ID&amp;gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prefer an external secret manager over creating the Secret by hand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="commit-identity-of-the-agent"&gt;Commit identity of the agent&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="commit-identity-of-the-agent"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#commit-identity-of-the-agent" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The bot&amp;rsquo;s commit email uses the bot user ID, not the App ID:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;$(&lt;/span&gt;gh api &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;/users/&amp;lt;app-slug&amp;gt;%5Bbot%5D&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; --jq .id&lt;span class="k"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;echo&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;lt;app-slug&amp;gt;[bot] &amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;${&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="si"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;+&amp;lt;app-slug&amp;gt;[bot]@users.noreply.github.com&amp;gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commits created through the API with an installation token are signed by GitHub and attributed to
this identity automatically.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="rotate-credentials"&gt;Rotate credentials&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="rotate-credentials"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#rotate-credentials" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agent app private key: generate a new key, update the Secret, roll the broker (the chart&amp;rsquo;s
checksum annotation only covers a chart-managed Secret), then delete the old key.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Login app client secret: same order. Developer login tokens stay valid; they are checked
against the app, not the secret.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>Get agent tokens in GitHub Actions</title><link>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/pr-preview/pr-18/docs/guides/actions/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/pr-preview/pr-18/docs/guides/actions/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;Workflows exchange their OIDC token for an agent token. Where the broker is reachable decides
which runners can use it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Runner&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Broker endpoint&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Chart&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;GitHub-hosted&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;public &lt;code&gt;POST &amp;lt;public base URL&amp;gt;/token/actions&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;actionsRoute&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;self-hosted with internal network access&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;internal &lt;code&gt;POST &amp;lt;internal URL&amp;gt;/token/actions&lt;/code&gt; (or &lt;code&gt;/token&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;httpRoute&lt;/code&gt; or the Service&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;/token/actions&lt;/code&gt; accepts Actions OIDC tokens and nothing else, so &lt;code&gt;actionsRoute&lt;/code&gt; can be public: it
forwards exactly one path, &lt;code&gt;POST&lt;/code&gt; only, and developer logins, probes and metrics stay internal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="workflow"&gt;Workflow&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="workflow"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#workflow" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Workflows pick runner and broker URL from Actions variables, so one workflow serves both setups:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;jobs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;agent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;runs-on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;${{ vars.AGENT_RUNNER || &amp;#39;ubuntu-latest&amp;#39; }}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;permissions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;id-token&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;write&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;contents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;read&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;steps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class="nt"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;agent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;env&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;BROKER&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;${{ vars.AGENT_TOKEN_BROKER_ACTIONS_URL }}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;run&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sd"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="sd"&gt; oidc=$(curl -fsS -H &amp;#34;Authorization: Bearer $ACTIONS_ID_TOKEN_REQUEST_TOKEN&amp;#34; \
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="sd"&gt; &amp;#34;$ACTIONS_ID_TOKEN_REQUEST_URL&amp;amp;audience=token-broker&amp;#34; | jq -r .value)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="sd"&gt; token=$(curl -fsS &amp;#34;$BROKER/token/actions&amp;#34; -H &amp;#34;Authorization: Bearer $oidc&amp;#34; \
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="sd"&gt; -d &amp;#34;{\&amp;#34;repo\&amp;#34;:\&amp;#34;$GITHUB_REPOSITORY\&amp;#34;}&amp;#34; | jq -r .token)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="sd"&gt; echo &amp;#34;::add-mask::$token&amp;#34;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="sd"&gt; echo &amp;#34;token=$token&amp;#34; &amp;gt;&amp;gt; &amp;#34;$GITHUB_OUTPUT&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class="nt"&gt;uses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;anthropics/claude-code-action@v1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;github_token&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;${{ steps.agent.outputs.token }}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The audience must match &lt;code&gt;ACTIONS_OIDC_AUDIENCE&lt;/code&gt; (default &lt;code&gt;token-broker&lt;/code&gt;).
&lt;code&gt;AGENT_TOKEN_BROKER_ACTIONS_URL&lt;/code&gt; is the organization&amp;rsquo;s Actions variable with the broker&amp;rsquo;s base URL
for workflows: the public route for GitHub-hosted runners, or the internal URL for self-hosted
runners. The workflow appends &lt;code&gt;/token/actions&lt;/code&gt;. &lt;code&gt;AGENT_TOKEN_BROKER_URL&lt;/code&gt; is the internal URL for
developer machines (&lt;a href="../../getting-started/devcontainer/"&gt;Dev Container&lt;/a&gt;); the public route does
not serve their logins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The token covers only the repository the workflow runs in: the broker requires both the
&lt;code&gt;repository&lt;/code&gt; claim and &lt;code&gt;sub&lt;/code&gt; to name the requested repository. &lt;code&gt;sub&lt;/code&gt; is either the classic
&lt;code&gt;repo:owner/name:…&lt;/code&gt; or the immutable &lt;code&gt;repo:owner@ID/name@ID:…&lt;/code&gt;, whose IDs are checked against the
signed ID claims. The token expires after one hour.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="restrict-refs-and-workflows"&gt;Restrict refs and workflows&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="restrict-refs-and-workflows"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#restrict-refs-and-workflows" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;By default any workflow in a repository the app is installed on may get a token. Two chart values
narrow that. Both are lists of patterns where &lt;code&gt;*&lt;/code&gt; matches any characters, including &lt;code&gt;/&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;config&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;actionsOidc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# `ref` claim: only the default branch and release tags&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;allowedRefs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;refs/heads/main, &amp;#34;refs/tags/v*&amp;#34;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# `job_workflow_ref` claim: only a shared agent workflow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;allowedWorkflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;my-org/agent-workflows/.github/workflows/agent.yml@*&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A request must match one pattern of each configured list. Empty lists apply no restriction. Pull
request runs carry &lt;code&gt;ref: refs/pull/&amp;lt;n&amp;gt;/merge&lt;/code&gt;, so &lt;code&gt;allowedRefs&lt;/code&gt; without &lt;code&gt;refs/pull/*&lt;/code&gt; blocks
agents on pull requests.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Sign agent commits</title><link>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/pr-preview/pr-18/docs/guides/signed-commits/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/pr-preview/pr-18/docs/guides/signed-commits/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;git commit&lt;/code&gt; in a container makes unsigned commits: GitHub signs app commits only when it creates
them itself. Rulesets with &lt;code&gt;required_signatures&lt;/code&gt; then block them on protected branches. Squash
merges still work, because GitHub signs the squash commit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;agent-commit&lt;/code&gt; sends the staged changes to the GraphQL mutation &lt;code&gt;createCommitOnBranch&lt;/code&gt; and moves
the local branch onto the signed commit:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git add -A
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;agent-commit -m &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;feat: something&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; -m &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;Body.&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="c1"&gt;# or -F &amp;lt;file&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It pushes as it commits; there is no separate &lt;code&gt;git push&lt;/code&gt;. A branch missing on origin is created
at &lt;code&gt;HEAD&lt;/code&gt;, which must already be on GitHub.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It refuses if the local branch has commits that origin lacks, and for new executables or mode
changes: the API has no file mode, so new files land as &lt;code&gt;100644&lt;/code&gt;. Commit those with
&lt;code&gt;git commit&lt;/code&gt; and merge with squash.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It creates no merge commits; rebase onto the base branch instead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;AGENT_COMMIT_MODE=local&lt;/code&gt; turns it into plain &lt;code&gt;git commit&lt;/code&gt;, for repositories that do not want
API commits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the Dev Container, &lt;code&gt;/etc/claude-code/CLAUDE.md&lt;/code&gt; tells Claude Code to use &lt;code&gt;agent-commit&lt;/code&gt;. With
the Claude Code plugin, the guard blocks &lt;code&gt;git commit&lt;/code&gt; and points Claude here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="../../reference/client-cli/#agent-commit"&gt;&lt;code&gt;agent-commit&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for the full reference.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Set review rules</title><link>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/pr-preview/pr-18/docs/guides/review-rules/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/pr-preview/pr-18/docs/guides/review-rules/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;The agent app has contents write permission, so its approvals would count toward required
reviews. Bots cannot be code owners, so a code owner review closes the gap. Every repository the
app is installed on therefore needs:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;code&gt;CODEOWNERS&lt;/code&gt; file that names human teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A rule on the default branch that requires a &lt;strong&gt;code owner review&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No bypass for the agent app in any ruleset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agent commits and pull requests then show up as the app&amp;rsquo;s bot and need a human review.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require signed commits, merge agent pull requests with &lt;strong&gt;squash&lt;/strong&gt;, so the commit on the
protected branch is created and signed by GitHub. See &lt;a href="../signed-commits/"&gt;Sign agent commits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See also &lt;a href="../github-apps/"&gt;Set up the GitHub Apps&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Use the scripts in your own image</title><link>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/pr-preview/pr-18/docs/guides/image-without-feature/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://pflege-de-labs.github.io/token-broker/pr-preview/pr-18/docs/guides/image-without-feature/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;If you cannot use the &lt;a href="../../getting-started/devcontainer/"&gt;Dev Container Feature&lt;/a&gt;, install the
client scripts in your image yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="what-the-image-needs"&gt;What the image needs&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="what-the-image-needs"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#what-the-image-needs" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;bash&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;curl&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;jq&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;git&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;gh&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;github-mcp-server&lt;/code&gt; only for the MCP server.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The scripts in &lt;code&gt;/usr/local/bin&lt;/code&gt;, with &lt;code&gt;agent-gh&lt;/code&gt; installed &lt;strong&gt;as &lt;code&gt;gh&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;. It must come before the
real &lt;code&gt;gh&lt;/code&gt; in &lt;code&gt;PATH&lt;/code&gt;; the wrapper finds the real one itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;TOKEN_BROKER_URL&lt;/code&gt; in the environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;System git config:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# The empty value drops inherited helpers (store, osxkeychain, gh) for github.com.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git config --system credential.https://github.com.helper &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git config --system --add credential.https://github.com.helper &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;!agent-token-git-credential&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Without the path git cannot say which repo it needs a token for.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git config --system credential.https://github.com.useHttpPath &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# Credential helpers only work over HTTPS.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git config --system url.https://github.com/.insteadOf git@github.com:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git config --system --add url.https://github.com/.insteadOf ssh://git@github.com/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A volume for &lt;code&gt;~/.cache/agent-token&lt;/code&gt;, so the login survives container restarts. It holds the
developer&amp;rsquo;s login token (8 hours) and agent tokens (1 hour); keep it per developer, never
shared.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The agent should act only as the agent app, so the wrapper refuses &lt;code&gt;gh auth login&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;refresh&lt;/code&gt; and
&lt;code&gt;setup-git&lt;/code&gt;. Outside a checkout, &lt;code&gt;gh auth status&lt;/code&gt; reports the agent-token login. Commands without
one target repository (&lt;code&gt;gh api orgs/...&lt;/code&gt;) get no agent token and fail unauthenticated, by design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="install-a-pinned-release"&gt;Install a pinned release&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="install-a-pinned-release"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#install-a-pinned-release" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Check the tarball against its sha256 from the release&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code&gt;checksums.txt&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-dockerfile" data-lang="dockerfile"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;FROM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;docker.io/library/debian:bookworm-slim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;RUN&lt;/span&gt; apt-get update &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends bash ca-certificates curl git gh jq &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;ARG&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;AGENT_TOKEN_VERSION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&amp;lt;release, e.g. 0.6.0&amp;gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;ARG&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;AGENT_TOKEN_SHA256&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&amp;lt;its sha256&amp;gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;RUN&lt;/span&gt; curl -fsSL -o /tmp/agent-token.tgz &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;https://github.com/pflege-de-labs/token-broker/releases/download/v&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;$AGENT_TOKEN_VERSION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;/agent-token-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;$AGENT_TOKEN_VERSION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;.tar.gz&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;echo&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;$AGENT_TOKEN_SHA256&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt; /tmp/agent-token.tgz&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; sha256sum -c - &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; tar -xzf /tmp/agent-token.tgz -C /tmp &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; install -m &lt;span class="m"&gt;755&lt;/span&gt; /tmp/bin/agent-token /tmp/bin/agent-token-git-credential /tmp/bin/agent-github-mcp /tmp/bin/agent-commit /usr/local/bin/ &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; install -m &lt;span class="m"&gt;755&lt;/span&gt; /tmp/bin/agent-gh /usr/local/bin/gh &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; rm -rf /tmp/agent-token.tgz /tmp/bin&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;RUN&lt;/span&gt; git config --system credential.https://github.com.helper &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; git config --system --add credential.https://github.com.helper &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;!agent-token-git-credential&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; git config --system credential.https://github.com.useHttpPath &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; git config --system url.https://github.com/.insteadOf git@github.com: &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;&amp;amp;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; git config --system --add url.https://github.com/.insteadOf ssh://git@github.com/&lt;span class="err"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;ENV&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;TOKEN_BROKER_URL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;https://&amp;lt;broker&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Debian&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code&gt;gh&lt;/code&gt; lands in &lt;code&gt;/usr/bin&lt;/code&gt;, after &lt;code&gt;/usr/local/bin&lt;/code&gt; in &lt;code&gt;PATH&lt;/code&gt;. Add Claude Code and your
toolchain as usual.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="build-run-log-in"&gt;Build, run, log in&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="build-run-log-in"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#build-run-log-in" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;podman build -t agent-dev .
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;podman volume create agent-token-cache
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;podman run -it --name agent-dev &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; -v agent-token-cache:/root/.cache/agent-token &lt;span class="se"&gt;\
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; -v &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nv"&gt;$PWD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;:/work -w /work agent-dev bash
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# inside, once per 8h:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;agent-token --login&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From another terminal: &lt;code&gt;podman exec -it agent-dev agent-token --login&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>